<title>RUSSIA: Russian MinFins firm consolidating on new levels.</title>
<headline>Russian MinFins firm consolidating on new levels.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices of Russian MinFin bonds firmed amid buying interest from both Russian and Western operators in the absence of depressing factors.</p>
<p>			tranche   Apr 21		   Apr 18</p>
<p>    1999 maturity   (3)     85.00-85.20	   84.85-84.95</p>
<p>    2003 maturity   (4)     60.10-60.30	   59.90-60.15</p>
<p>    2008 maturity   (5)     41.40-41.60	   41.25-41.40</p>
<p>    2006 maturity   (6)     47.30-47.50	   47.00-47.25</p>
<p>    2011 maturity   (7)     36.75-37.00	   36.65-36.80</p>
<p>--Artyom Danielyan, Moscow Newsroom (095) 941 8520</p>
</text>
